{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Two-digit month display 06 — one 400-point board",
  "description": "Fits ONE 400-point, 30-row breadboard. Two CD4511 decoders and two common-cathode displays show 06 (June). Each segment has a 330-ohm resistor. The first decoder starts at f1 and its display at f10; the second starts at f16 and its display at f25. This is the single-board version of the full 0611 date display.",
